--!strict
--[[
	Assets
	EVERY asset ID in the game lives here. Nothing else should hard-code an ID.

	All values are placeholders until you replace them:
	  * images / sounds: "rbxassetid://0"  -> paste your real "rbxassetid://123456"
	  * badges / game passes / developer products: 0 -> paste the numeric ID

	Assets.isPlaceholder(id) lets code skip loading things that aren't filled in yet.
	The Stage 3 Theme module re-exports this file so UI code has one place to look.
]]

